# The Kite Meadow (CIPlay the_kite_meadow): the plan The Rainmakers' third island, quest "Kites Over the Ridge"
# The cliff path up from the south beach (0 -60, 3 m) past the crew hut's ledge (7..10 -52..-49, 8 m) and the vines
# (z -38) to the meadow (20 m); the masts x -25.3..25.3 at z 16; the launch shed x -4.5..4.5 z 24..28.5.
island The Kite Meadow
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Kites Over the Ridge
wait 5
expect animals Warthog 5
expect shown kitesdown
expect hidden kitesup
zone cliff_path
expect step 1
read Kite crew roster
expect step 2
open Crew hut chest
wait 3
expect item Machete 1
expect item Blueprint_Machete 1
expect step 4
expect shown kitevines
use kitevines
expect hidden kitevines
zone upper_meadow
expect step 5
kill Warthog
expect step 6
read Winch 2 log
read Winch 7 log
read Winch 11 log
expect step 7
code shedkeypad 123 wrong
code shedkeypad 419
expect hidden shedgate
expect story shedopen 1
expect step 8
use shedbell
expect message Nobody rings it
open Fuel store
expect message Start the engine
use winchengine
open Winch fuel can
use winchengine
expect story kitesup 1
expect shown kitesup
expect hidden kitesdown
expect step 9
open Fuel store
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_Fueltank 1
expect item Blueprint_Pipe_Fuel 1
expect step 12
open Biofuel press
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_BiofuelExtractor 1
expect step 14
use shedbell
expect story bellrung 1
expect done
